{"_id":"68a7360d8ec3d8323af1262c","nodeId":"Z7jp_Juj5PffSxV7UZcBb","roadmapSlug":"backend","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:53.149Z","description":"# ORMs\n\nORM (Object-Relational Mapping) allows developers to interact with databases using object-oriented concepts. Maps database tables to classes and rows to objects, eliminating raw SQL queries. Simplifies data manipulation and improves maintainability. Popular ORMs: Hibernate (Java), Entity Framework (.NET), SQLAlchemy (Python).","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"What is an ORM, how does it work, and how should I use one?","url":"https://stackoverflow.com/a/1279678","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb44ab"},{"type":"article","title":"What is an ORM","url":"https://www.freecodecamp.org/news/what-is-an-orm-the-meaning-of-object-relational-mapping-database-tools/","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb44ac"},{"type":"video","title":"Why Use an ORM?","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vHt2LC1EM3Q","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb44ad"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T07:26:50.654Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04ddfb5fcb94d0416999","title":"roadmap.sh - Master SQL","partner":"roadmap.sh","type":"course","url":"https://roadmap.sh/courses/sql"},{"_id":"6a5e04ddfb5fcb94d04169c1","title":"Scrimba - Backend Developer Career Path","partner":"Scrimba","type":"course","url":"http://scrimba.com/the-backend-developer-path-c0tbi0l98f?via=roadmap"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/backend/content/Z7jp_Juj5PffSxV7UZcBb.md"}